msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That can't be right."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_five/0/g-0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why don't more people devote their life to hate, then?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_five/0/g-0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow, sounds like I need more hate in my life then."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_five/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Oh no, it is."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_five/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You think I'd lie to you? Me, your best friend and confidant, Reggie?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_five/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Look around you, kid. Why do you think the world is so evil?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_five/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "It's because hate rules, and all the most powerful people know it."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_five/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Absolutely! We all do."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_five/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Look, I only want the best for you."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_five/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "And the best thing for you, for me, and for literally everyone?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_five/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Hate, baby."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_five/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Come back anytime you wanna hear more about Hate."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/6
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Wow, you got ten of us to hate you!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/14
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You could really cut the rejection with a knife!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You mean tension?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's getting easier."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Haha, nope!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "That's what I like to hear."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Back for your daily dose of hate, huh? Can't say I blame you."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Nothing feels as good as hate. They might try to tell you love is better for you, but..."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Who is 'they' anyway? What qualifies 'they' to tell you anything at all?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Me on the other hand, I've got a PhD in hate. In some circles they call me 'Dr. Hate.'"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "But I'm just a humble personification of rejection... so please, continue to call me Reggie."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/g-0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Dr. Hate has kind of a nice ring to it though."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/g-0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did you get your degree from a cereal box?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/g-0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What university did you attend? I'd like to study hate myself."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "It does sound pretty badass... but titles can contribute to distance."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "And I'd never want you to feel anything less than close to me."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Wow, look at you! Hating on my achievements!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "I'm so proud..."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Oh, you've never heard of it. And it's <i>very</i> expensive."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You should just stick to self-study."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Some people might throw their education around in an attempt to impress and intimidate you..."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "But I just want you to know that as a budding student of hate you're in excellent hands."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_ten/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "So keep it hateful, my sweet pupil. You too can become a lightning rod of hate if you try hard enough."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_twenty/0/6
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You know, a little hateful birdie told me about these fancy <w>friendship candies...</w>"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_twenty/0/14
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Apparently they can be used to undo hate and help you make friends with objects around the house."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_twenty/0/22
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Hate doesn't even have to be permanent. You can eat one of these sweets and wipe that right on out."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_twenty/0/30
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "What a disgusting concept. Imagine taking something as wonderful as candy and perverting it to achieve your own dark aims."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_twenty/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is friendship really a dark aim?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_twenty/0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "God that's disgusting."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_twenty/0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Doesn't everyone deserve a second chance?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_twenty/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "It's the darkest aim there is, honey."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_twenty/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Well... almost. Love is the absolute worst."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_twenty/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "But friendship is right up there."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_twenty/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_twenty/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Who needs a second chance when you've gotten it right the first time?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_twenty/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Now listen. You've got a promising future with hate, so I'm gonna give you a free pass here."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_twenty/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "When it comes to these nasty little candies..."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_twenty/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "If you've already got some, flush them down the toilet."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_twenty/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "If you don't have any, don't let anyone give them to you."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_twenty/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "I won't ask, and you don't have to tell."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_twenty/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Just don't let some gross little candies ruin the hate you've worked so hard to achieve, alright?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_twenty/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "And remember: keep it hateful."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/6
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Ahh another beautiful, hateful day."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hi Reggie."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You again..."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Guess I fucked up another date..."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "I bet it must be tiring getting to know all these objects in your house."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Did you know that hate is not only the best path, but the easiest path?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Like, really—you get the same amount of SPECS points for a relationship that ends in hate as you do for one that ends in love or friendship."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "It can be hard sometimes to know the way to someone's heart. Everyone is so different, after all."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "But hate? A safe, easy path."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You can be assured that in MOST cases, save, you know, 'interesting' objects like Tina..."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/g-0/51
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "That just being a dismissive asshole is the simplest path to both hate AND an early ending."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/g-0/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow, hate really is the best choice."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/g-0/60/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't want to be an asshole."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/g-0/61/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This isn't much fun if I just take the easiest way out."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Isn't it? I'm telling you."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "What's wrong with being an asshole? Life is much more interesting with a little spice."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Are you here to have fun or are you here to DATE?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Trust me, the more time you save dealing with these other loser objects the more time you'll have to spend on yourself... and me!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Just remember this, my budding little hate blossom."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Always take the easy way out wherever possible."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "And the easiest way? Hate. Always hate."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_thirty/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Keep it simple and keep it hateful."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/6
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "We've been talking for some time now... I'm pleased you want to know so much about hate."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You got another lesson for me?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can't believe I've gotten so many hate endings..."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Listen... If you lead with hate, you'll never have to worry about love and friendship finding you."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You push everyone away from the outset no one in their right mind will ever want to be close to you."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Sure, some might think you're trying to play hard-to-get, but even they will get bored after a while."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/g-0/24/b/1
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Thanks to that advice I've never had a single friend - except you, of course. And look at how sexy and successful I am now!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/g-0/25/b/1
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Thanks to that advice I've never had a single lover - except you of course. And look at how sexy and successful I am now!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/g-0/26/b/1
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Thanks to that advice I've never had a single friend or lover. And look at how sexy and successful I am now!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/g-0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You <i>are</i> very sexy and successful..."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/g-0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't want anyone to hate me."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/g-0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How is being a lonely loser successful?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "I am, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "And that could be you too, honey."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You might as well say 'I don't want to succeed in life! I want to be a loser shut-in in a relationship with my couch!'"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Uh, I'm not a lonely loser? I'm the king of hate, baby."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/g-0/c-4/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought you said you were Dr. Hate?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/g-0/c-4/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you say so."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/g-0/c-4/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Kings can be doctors, too."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/g-0/c-4/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "My life actually rules."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You know I only want the best for you, my sweet little hater-in-training."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "And the best? It can only ever be hate."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_forty/0/g-1/16 reggie_rejection/reggie_sixty/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Keep it hateful, honey."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/6
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You hear about this Realization bullshit? I overheard Skylar talking about it..."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/14
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Whose brilliant idea was that? Turning inanimate objects human?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/22
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "What, you're just going to create life out of nowhere and plunk them down into human society? Fully grown, zero guidance, no social security number... just... here you are?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/30
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You're just gonna play god and grant your toilet humanity?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Isn't humanity the highest form of life?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess it does sound kind of bad when you put it that way."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/40/s/0 reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But I could Realize you too, Reggie..."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Uh... no."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "It's cute and expected that you guys think that, though. Really adorable."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "It's because it is bad. Terrible idea."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Terrible idea."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/c-1/15/c-1/7 reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Well yes you could, in which case it would be a great idea."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "No object in this house deserves Realization. It's too great a gift to give."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "But I want to be clear here—if you're considering doing it to me, yes, yes you should."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What would you even do with it?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll remember that."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "It's simple!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Everyone in this house sucks but me."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Spread hate into the wider world, obviously."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "See that you do."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Realization is like awards shows when you think about it."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Meaningless Bullshit when it comes to everyone else, but if you want to give it to me?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Excellent idea, perfect, can't go wrong. Justifies its entire existence."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "So as you get back out there, remember: nobody deserves Realization but me."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_fifty/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Keep it nasty and keep it hateful, baby."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_sixty/0/6
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Remember when we talked about that most disgusting of gifts, Realization?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_sixty/0/14
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Well did you know that the only way to Realize an object is to have a love or friendship relationship with them?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_sixty/0/22
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "That's right! If you follow the righteous path of Hate, you won't even be tempted with Realization."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_sixty/0/30
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Just another reason why hate is great."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_sixty/0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But I want to Realize everyone..."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_sixty/0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to keep my options open."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_sixty/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Damn, you're so right."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_sixty/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Don't say things like that, someone might hear you."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_sixty/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "What a horrifying thought."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_sixty/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Why keep them open when there's only one correct solution?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_sixty/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Hate all the way. No need to consider anything else."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_sixty/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "I always am, baby. I always am."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_sixty/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "There's so many reasons to walk the path of hate. But the fact that it simplifies your life?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_sixty/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "I mean really, what <i>can't</i> hate do?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_sixty/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Think about that when you get back out there."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_seventy/0/6
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You know, there's something else you ought to know about Realization—something objects like Skylar would never tell you."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_seventy/0/14
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Did you know that when an object is Realized they actually leave your house forever?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_seventy/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I've seen it happen."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_seventy/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "For real?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_seventy/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "That's right, your beloved object takes that Realization and leaves you!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_seventy/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "All the memories you've made together, all that time spent... just up and leaves!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_seventy/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You can never speak to them again in your home."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_seventy/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Isn't that just the most horrible thing you've ever heard?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_seventy/0/g-0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you love someone you have to be prepared to let them go."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_seventy/0/g-0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
