msgid "Don't lie to me honey, you don't have to save face."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Don't be bitter I won..."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "I did, I truly did."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "The final lesson is this: trust no one, not even me."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Except you can always trust me, because I'm the only one who'll guide you down the right path... the MOST righteous path..."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "The path of hate."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-2/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's gotta be a collectable dude. Something."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Oh sure. Here."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-2/c-9/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He holds a small badge out to you that says 'Hate Everything'."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-2/c-9/26
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "I made it myself."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-2/c-9/34
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "And now, you've got nothing left to do, my little protege, except leave this thing-filled domicile of yours."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-2/c-9/42
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Go out the front door and get rid of those damn glasses!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-2/c-9/50/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Does this mean I'll never see you again?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-2/c-9/50/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is there anything else?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-2/c-9/50/c-0/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Yeah! Get the fuck outta here!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-2/c-9/50/c-1/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "No way. This is the bad ending! The best one of all!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-3/3
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "And one last time—say it with me!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-3/11
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Keep it hateful."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-3/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Keep it hateful."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-3/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You suck."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-3/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Goodbye, forever, Regina."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-3/c-11/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Hell yeah I do!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_100/0/g-3/c-12/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Bye sucker!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You got rejected by Rejection."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_hate_return/0/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Doesn't get any weirder than that."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_hate_return/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't like this anymore... my head hurts. (USE SASS CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_hate_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can you explain what our relationship is like?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_hate_return/0/c-0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Reggie clutches at his chest, looking deeply offended and disgusted to his very core."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_hate_return/0/c-0/25
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You... you're using one of those candies to get me to... love you or something?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_hate_return/0/c-0/33/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know what Reggie? I'm honestly just confused."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_hate_return/0/c-0/33/c-0/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Really?? Me too!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_hate_return/0/c-0/33/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wanna just make this simple and be friends?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_hate_return/0/c-0/33/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_hate_return/0/c-0/33/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Keep the damn candy - I hate those things."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realize_join/0/10
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Really? You're gonna bring me to life?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realize_join/0/18
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You sure that's a good idea?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realize_join/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course it is."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realize_join/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hmm... maybe not."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realize_join/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Of <i>course</i> it is."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realize_join/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Aw... I won't bite too hard."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realize_join/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "But do you even have the stats?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realize_join/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know I've got the stats."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realize_join/0/g-0/18/s/0 reggie_rejection/reggie_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, not just yet."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realize_join/0/g-0/c-3/10
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "No prob, G."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realize_join/0/g-0/c-3/18
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You'll still get to see me make my cameos every time you get a hate ending."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Thinking about unleashing me into the world?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You will now be unleashed!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Figures."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Really? The first thing you're gonna make real is Reggie? Sheesh."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Here we go - I hope slash don't hope this works..."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realize_begin/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely the manifestation of rejection itself, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Reggie looks at his hands, waggling his fingers before looking down at his legs and giving each a good shake."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realized/0/14
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Oh baby I got APPENDAGES now. The HATING I'm gonna do..."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realized/0/22
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "The world doesn't know what's comin' for it."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realized/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're free Reggie - go do... anything you like."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realized/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But first - maybe a little hanky-panky?"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_realized/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Oh I shall..."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_divert/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Reggie lets out a belly laugh that is both attractive and hurtful."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_divert/0/11
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Haha! No way am I gonna do you."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_divert/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Should have figured..."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_divert/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He raises an eyebrow, shooting you a smirk."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_divert/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Just kiddin'."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_divert/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Couldn't help but give one last rejection."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_divert/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Let's blast off and work off all this friction between us..."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_divert/0/c-0/42
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Reggie's constant talk of hate and negativity might have had you concerned about how a romp with him would go down—but you needn't have worried. There's a fine line between love and hate, and you and Reggie dance back and forth over it all night long."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_divert/0/c-0/50
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Does he love you? Does he hate you? You don't care as long as he keeps touching you like that."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_divert/0/c-0/55
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Reggie somehow manages to make you feel both disrespected and cherished all at once. He's a proper tease, dangling your release just out of reach until you find yourself going a bit mad, and then pushing you over the edge until the only word you can manage to speak is his name."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_divert/0/c-0/63
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When it's all over he leaves you there in the bed without so much as a goodbye, only a rude little tousle of your hair. He sneaks off before the sun rises, smugly muttering something to himself about 'all the best hate is done in the dark.'"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Reggie burst forth into society with one aim on his mind..."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_join/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Hate! Hate! Gimme all the hate, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_join/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He went looking and found hate immediately: he signed up for all the nearest hate groups, looked into hate crimes, and found that there was even a hate rally going on."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_join/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As he arrived, one thing became immediately apparent."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_join/35
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "What the hell!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_join/46
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "This shit's lame as fuck!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_join/54
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "While Reggie liked to style himself as a hater, it was clear that the real world practice of hate was a much crueler, distasteful thing."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_join/62
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "I'm more of a... mischief maker. A loveable scamp!"
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_join/70
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "This is... just boring."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_join/78
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "So, with his trademark style and flair, Reggie organised his own group, Haters Gonna Bait. Armed with banana peels, slingshots and handshake buzzers, Reggie's army of tricksters descended upon any rally they found to give those in attendance a bevy of annoying nuisances."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_join/86
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Their stated goal to \"Turn the hate down a notch\" has successfully caused a great number of groups to declare that the stains on their pants aren't worth the trouble any more, and disband."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_join/94
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Of course, any time that happened, Reggie arrived seemingly out of thin air to give the perfect rejoinder."
msgstr ""

#: reggie_rejection/reggie_love_join/102
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Later, haters!"
msgstr ""
